  "info": {
    "name": "PetStore API - Contract Tests (POST /pet)",
    "description": "Contract test pack for POST /pet of the Swagger PetStore API: 2 positive, 8 negative and 5 edge-case tests. Found 4 critical bugs (500 Server Error instead of 400) and 5 validation issues. Author: Nadiia Hodovanets.",
